OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F321A1790615961
OL,3,CHow far do Carlisle United have to
OL,4,Cfall before something changes?
OL,6,FIt was the manner of that second half
OL,7,Fthat was so concerning. The bare
OL,8,Fminimum fans expect is effort, a bit
OL,9,Fof fight and players looking like it
OL,10,Fmatters. I couldn't see much of any of
OL,11,Fthose things as a game that had been
OL,12,Fin the balance at the break drifted
OL,13,Finto a drubbing.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBBorder SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,322,350,250,120,000,100
PN,32103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F321A1790615961
OL,3,CHow far do Carlisle United have to
OL,4,Cfall before something changes?
OL,6,FLet's not forget that Woking sat below
OL,7,FRob Elliot's side in the league going
OL,8,Finto the game. This wasn't a case of a
OL,9,Fbad day at the office against quality
OL,10,Fopponents, this was a pretty dire
OL,11,Fperformance in a season that has
OL,12,Fstarted so badly it has shocked even
OL,13,Fthe hardened older supporters familiar
OL,14,Fwith the bad old days. This situation
OL,15,F- 19th in the National League after 10
OL,16,Fgames - is objectively a new low in
OL,17,Fthe club's history.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
