PN,32106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F321A1790615961
OL,3,CHow far do Carlisle United have to
OL,4,Cfall before something changes?
OL,6,FI hate to be sounding so negative, but
OL,7,Fwhat is there honestly so far this
OL,8,Fseason to be positive about?
OL,10,FYou can blame who you want, and
OL,11,Freading social media there are a
OL,12,Fnumber of names being measured up for
OL,13,Fblame. It's not for me to say that I
OL,14,Fknow all the answers to a situation
OL,15,Fthat is probably complicated with a
OL,16,Fnumber of contributary factors, but
OL,17,Fsomething needs to change.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
