PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F321A1790615961
OL,3,CHow far do Carlisle United have to
OL,4,Cfall before something changes?
OL,6,FLast season while some fans didn't
OL,7,Fcare for Mark Hughes' tactics he did
OL,8,Fproduce a record points total and gave
OL,9,Fthe club a puncher's chance of getting
OL,10,Fback into the Football League.
OL,12,FThis season they have been so off the
OL,13,Fpace it has been unreal.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
