OL,3,CHow far do Carlisle United have to
OL,4,Cfall before something changes?
OL,6,FThe supporters Simpson drew back to
OL,7,Fthe club during his remarkable second
OL,8,Fperiod in charge have been loyal and
OL,9,Fpatient. There was still a big crowd
OL,10,Fon Saturday, but as we saw during the
OL,11,Fempty-ish stands era at the back end
OL,12,Fof Keith Millen's reign, there is a
OL,13,Flimit.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G8/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
