CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F321A1790615961
OL,3,CHow far do Carlisle United have to
OL,4,Cfall before something changes?
OL,6,FFans who streamed out of Wembley in
OL,7,F2023 had high hopes of a brave new
OL,8,Fworld where Carlisle marched up the
OL,9,Fleague on the crest of a wave. At the
OL,10,Fmoment, and in truth for most of the
OL,11,Ftime since that grand day out in
OL,12,FLondon, they've been caught up in the
OL,13,Fundertow, being dragged ever deeper
OL,14,Finto decline.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G9/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
